'==================================================================================
' SECTION: DEPLOYMENT ARCHITECTURE
' FILE: 02_Deployment_Architecture_HighLevel_v5.puml
' JUDUL: Deployment Architecture v5 (High-Level)
' SUMBER: TDD SID Desa Cibenda v5.0 (Section 5.2.1 Table 7, Section 5.6.2,
'         Section 8.2.1) + SID-ARCH-SYS-001 v1.1 (S5 Topologi Deployment)
' CATATAN: Menggantikan 02_Deployment_Architecture_5_2_5_v4.puml (versi
'          ringkas/high-level dari 2 file deployment v4.2). Sama seperti
'          versi detail, infrastruktur TIDAK BERUBAH dari v4.2 - lihat
'          catatan revisi di akhir file.
' BASIS PENYUSUNAN (bukan detail teknis yang dikarang):
'   - TDD Table 7 (Tech Stack Tahap 1): Laravel REST API, React (pisah repo),
'     PostgreSQL, Laravel Queue (database driver), Laravel Scheduler
'   - TDD 5.6.2 (Infrastruktur & Deployment): wajib HTTPS (TLS 1.2/1.3),
'     firewall hanya buka port 80/443/SSH, SSH key auth, fail2ban
'   - TDD Table 66 (Asumsi Infrastruktur): server minimum 2 vCPU/2GB RAM/20GB SSD
'   - TDD Known Constraint (Table 70): Docker BELUM dipakai Tahap 1
'   - TDD Known Constraint (Table 70): Redis belum dipakai Tahap 1
'   - SID-ARCH-SYS-001 S5: topologi Staging (Hosting Kampus) vs Production
'     (Hosting Desa, setelah Gate G7)
' Skenario dipilih: Single VPS (semua komponen 1 server), level High-level.
' Detail presisi (versi Nginx, jumlah worker, port SSH kustom, dll) TIDAK
' digambar karena tidak tercatat di TDD manapun & infrastruktur server desa
' sendiri masih berstatus pending konfirmasi (TDD Table 68).
'==================================================================================

@startuml 5.2.5b_v5 Diagram Deployment Architecture High-Level
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor #EBF3FB
  BorderColor #2E5FA3
  FontName Arial
  FontSize 12
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #D5F5E3
  BorderColor #1E8449
  FontName Arial
  FontSize 12
}
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #D6E4F7
  BorderColor #1F3864
  FontName Arial
  FontSize 11
}
skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor #FEF9E7
  BorderColor #F39C12
  FontName Arial
  FontSize 12
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #D6E4F7
  BorderColor #1F3864
  FontName Arial
  FontSize 12
}
skinparam arrow {
  Color #2E5FA3
  FontName Arial
  FontSize 10
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF9C4
  BorderColor #F9A825
  FontName Arial
  FontSize 10
}

title Diagram Deployment Architecture - SID Desa Cibenda\n(Skenario: Single VPS - High-Level) [v5.0]

actor "Warga / RT / RW / Kasi / Kaur /\nPetugas Desa / Kepala Desa /\nSekretaris Desa / Kadus" as USER

cloud "Internet" as NET {
}

node "VPS - Single Server\n(Minimum: 2 vCPU, 2GB RAM, 20GB SSD)" as VPS {

  component "Nginx\n(Reverse Proxy + HTTPS/TLS)" as NGINX

  component "React SPA\n(Static Build)" as REACT

  component "Laravel REST API\n(PHP-FPM)\nPipeline Approval Dinamis" as LARAVEL

  component "Queue Worker\n(Supervisor - database driver)" as WORKER

  component "Laravel Scheduler\n(Cron)" as SCHED

  database "PostgreSQL" as DB

  component "Local Storage\n(Backup terenkripsi)" as BACKUP
}

cloud "Mail Server (SMTP)\n- Eksternal" as MAIL

USER --> NET : HTTPS (TLS 1.2/1.3)
NET --> NGINX : Port 443 (HTTPS)\nPort 80 -> redirect 443

NGINX --> REACT : Serve static assets
NGINX --> LARAVEL : Reverse proxy\n/api/*

LARAVEL --> DB : Query\n(Eloquent ORM)
LARAVEL --> WORKER : Dispatch Job\n(queue: database,\nSendNotificationJob generik)
WORKER --> DB : Ambil & proses job
SCHED --> DB : Cron job\n(reminder, backup)
LARAVEL ..> MAIL : Kirim notifikasi email\n(opsional)
SCHED --> BACKUP : Backup terjadwal\n(dienkripsi)

note bottom of VPS
  Seluruh komponen berjalan pada 1 server yang sama.
  Docker BELUM dipakai di Tahap 1 (environment manual,
  bukan containerized) - masuk Tahap 2.
  Redis belum dipakai - queue driver masih "database".
  --
  v5.0: Laravel REST API kini menjalankan pipeline
  approval berbasis konfigurasi (letter_categories/
  approval_flows/flow_steps) - TIDAK menambah
  requirement resource, murni perubahan level aplikasi.
  --
  *** INFRASTRUKTUR TIDAK BERUBAH DARI v4.2 ***
end note

note right of NGINX
  Firewall: hanya port 80, 443,
  dan SSH (port kustom) yang dibuka.
  SSH key authentication aktif,
  password login dinonaktifkan.
  fail2ban aktif untuk proteksi
  brute-force SSH & login endpoint.
  TIDAK BERUBAH dari v4.2.
end note

note right of MAIL
  Infrastruktur server definitif
  (VPS cloud / shared hosting / server
  fisik desa) masih PENDING konfirmasi
  dari pihak desa (TDD Table 68).
end note

note left of USER
  v5.0: Kadus TETAP tercantum sebagai
  aktor pengguna sistem (akun tetap
  bisa login), meski tidak lagi
  berperan sebagai approver di
  pipeline surat. Tidak ada perubahan
  jalur akses/koneksi untuk Kadus
  dibanding role lain - tetap lewat
  jalur HTTPS yang sama.
end note

note as TOPOLOGY #E8F5E9
  TOPOLOGI ENVIRONMENT (SID-ARCH-SYS-001 S5):
  Staging    -> Hosting Kampus
                (aktif sejak Sprint Foundation)
  Production -> Hosting Desa
                (aktif setelah Gate G7 - Deployment
                Ready tercapai)
  Diagram di atas berlaku untuk KEDUA environment -
  hanya lokasi hosting fisik yang berbeda.
end note

@enduml

